              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Heather Zemp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have not had the best luck with frozen pies, or some pumpkin desserts, so I was skeptical. This was very yummy. The texture was nice, and the flavor was excellent. I didn't have any gingersnaps handy, so I used a pre-made graham cracker crust that I toasted in the oven at 400 degrees for 6 minutes, and it tasted great. Everyone loved it.",
            "datePublished": "2007-10-24T08:07:25.940Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
